{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"2001252c076875d7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Data Used IN Training",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-360,
			"y":-20,
			"width":540,
			"height":80,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"dbbcf909c43a86f2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Types of Data",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":357,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6c7a8bdc53e1852c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Structured Data\n- Organized in rows and columns\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-510,
			"y":537,
			"width":300,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"fca5f0971ef9ae92",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#1) Numerical Data (Quantitative)]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-940,
			"y":824,
			"width":400,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"b8d0564befff63ae",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#2) Categorical Data (Qualitative)]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-560,
			"y":1137,
			"width":400,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"0b3480cabc99f429",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#Un-Structured Data]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-40,
			"y":537,
			"width":460,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"f401c2e547608e50",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Sources of data",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":180,
			"y":357,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0f71f6e8555ce40a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#2. Secondary Source]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":417,
			"width":400,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"a2ba9a3d3671ed6a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#1. Primary Source]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":560,
			"y":60,
			"width":380,
			"height":267
		},
		{
			"id":"9746f9b41f21788c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Data Quality#Data Quality]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1684,
			"y":608,
			"width":540,
			"height":189
		},
		{
			"id":"a26e1066e9f6f655",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Accuracy:** Is a measure of how well the data accurately reflects the object being described.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1750,
			"y":1137,
			"width":390,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"25bffa1fd986625a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Timeliness:** Is a measure of data being available when its needed for decision making.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2010,
			"y":1014,
			"width":390,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"810c47e9a0ae3e03",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Consistency:** Is a measure of how consistent the data is",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1330,
			"y":1107,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"86c495fd0a5f7d6d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Validity:** Is a measure of how well the data fits within pre-defined limits, expectations, and standards\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1460,
			"y":1014,
			"width":440,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9d3592429eac0385",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Uniqueness:** Features or Objects should only be represented within a particular dataset only once.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1620,
			"y":904,
			"width":420,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c58a59808ef70376",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#Images]]\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":50,
			"y":1257,
			"width":280,
			"height":293
		},
		{
			"id":"98b455f67ae26abe",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#Time series]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-120,
			"y":897,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"ebfd2dd5d2968391",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Types of Data and Sources#Text]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":250,
			"y":868,
			"width":310,
			"height":293
		},
		{
			"id":"e2ec09e78143157e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Quality of Data",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-820,
			"y":357,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b2d5f4bd7db8ad6b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":" 1. Volume: Scale of data generated every second",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1620,
			"y":134,
			"width":320,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"92c0c8cbf3b07593",
			"type":"text",
			"text":" 2. Variety: Different Formats (e.g., Video, Text, Images)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1620,
			"y":254,
			"width":320,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"dd0d9ef94b8e3d85",
			"type":"text",
			"text":" 3. Velocity: Speed of generation and processing",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1620,
			"y":404,
			"width":320,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8bbc3fd212f180e8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Completeness:** Is a measure of whether all of the required data is present within the dataset and if it meets the objectives",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2360,
			"y":868,
			"width":470,
			"height":110
		},
		{
			"id":"36246906db0c817e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Feature Engineering",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-275,
			"y":-440,
			"width":370,
			"height":60,
			"color":"5"
		}
	],
